# Resi Studio Automation Rules

When assisting with Resi Studio:
- Execute commands using `./resi.py` CLI.
- Read `RESI_BEARER_TOKEN` from the environment.
- Transcode videos with `ffmpeg` using `-g 48 -keyint_min 48 -ar 48000 -ac 2` prior to Resi upload.
- Never output or log authorization bearer tokens or user account passwords.
